usage: tool [options] source [extra ...]

Process some files.

arguments:
  source     Input file
  extra ...  More inputs

options:
  -h, --help           show this help and exit
  -o, --output OUTPUT  Where to write (default: out.txt)
  --count COUNT        How many (default: 3)
  --ratio RATIO        (default: 0.5)
  --name NAME          Your name (required)
  -v, --verbose        Say more

out.txt 3 0.5 Ada false in.txt []
x.txt 7 2.0 Ada true in.txt [a, b]
out.txt 2 0.5 -dash false in.txt []
out.txt 3 0.5 Ada false -in.txt [--verbose]
